  "title": "Vegetarian Stout French Onion Soup",
  "description": "This vegetarian French onion soup simmered with stout beer and mushrooms is a festive meal to prepare on St. Patrick's day. Serve with your favorite stout!",
  "authors": [
    "Matthieu Duquette"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:58:27-04:00",
